# --- Overlay content is OURS; let it through the vendor/ rule above ---
# The overlay deliberately mirrors upstream paths, including under vendor/.
!overlay/**
!overlay/**/vendor/**

# --- Re-asserted LAST on purpose -------------------------------------
*.zip
# The !overlay/** exception above exists so the overlay can mirror upstream
# paths including under vendor/. Git uses the LAST matching rule, so those
# negations would also un-ignore game data and binaries dropped under
# overlay/. These rules come after them and win, so the exception stays
# narrow: overlay content is tracked, anything game-derived is not.
*.iso
*.gcm
*.dol
*.thp
*.fsys
*.gci
*.raw
*.gpk
*.szs
*.rarc
*.adp
*.h4m
*.wad
